WEBVTT

00:18:58.163 --> 00:19:01.204
pushed me to think a lot about,
which is, you know,

00:19:01.246 --> 00:19:04.621
if if if I'm going to play who who
believes in the value of courage

00:19:04.621 --> 00:19:08.538
and vulnerability. But I have a boss
or a leader who doesn't get it.

00:19:08.954 --> 00:19:11.746
Well, how do I manage up? I mean,
obviously, in an ideal world,

00:19:11.746 --> 00:19:14.371
I would just leave. But if
I don't have that option,

00:19:14.371 --> 00:19:17.746
is there anything I can do to nudge
a leader to take off the armor,

00:19:18.288 --> 00:19:21.579
to not be so ashamed to to be
a little bit more real?

00:19:22.371 --> 00:19:26.663
So one thing is I never tell people to
leave because I mean, leave if you can.

00:19:26.663 --> 00:19:28.538
But I just you know, I think you and

00:19:28.538 --> 00:19:30.704
I are both careful about that
in our in our work. Right.